        medium: 'Optimizes for the highest single hand. Understands basic tie-breaking. Stays blind for 1 round.',
        hard: 'Full combinatorial optimization (7-choose-3-choose-3). Tracks mucked cards from previous rounds. Coordinates betting with partition strength.',
